error[E0234]: `<-` needs a call that returns `(result, fs)`, but this returns `Result Bytes IoError`
 --> effects.ck:9:17
  |
9 |     contents <- files.read path fs
  |                 ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  = help: operations on authority capabilities (`fs`, `term`, …) return just their result: use `let`

error[E0230]: `try` can only be used where the block's value is the function's result
  --> effects.ck:14:17
   |
14 |         let z = try x
   |                 ^^^^^
   = help: `try` returns the error from the enclosing function; use `match` here instead

error[E0232]: `try` returns early with the error, so the result here must be `Option _`, but it is `Nat`
  --> effects.ck:19:13
   |
19 |     let y = try x
   |             ^^^^^ returns early from here

